{"id":"chatcmpl-76e169d0c95c4a039b63cb14d6604447","object":"chat.completion","created":1790609496,"model":"accounts/fireworks/models/glm-5p3-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n\"schema\": \"statement_candidate_v1\",\n\"request_id\": \"pilot-aero-primary-v1\",\n\"results\": [\n{\n\"requested_field\": \"AssetsCurrent\",\n\"outcome\": \"found\",\n\"value\": \"1979596\",\n\"scale\": \"1000\",\n\"source_label\": \"Consolidated statements of financial position — Total current assets, As of December 31, 2025\",\n\"unit\": \"USD\",\n\"currency\": \"USD\",\n\"period\": {\"kind\": \"instant\", \"start\": null, \"end\": \"2025-12-31\"},\n\"accounting_basis\": \"IFRS\",\n\"consolidation_scope\": \"consolidated\",\n\"location\": {\n\"accession\": \"0001193125-26-197494\",\n\"document\": \"d101275d20f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"b842756f7ce62b0ae1bd2cf14d6fc3373c61297c0a74934f020493332415326e\",\n\"table\": \"Consolidated statements of financial position\",\n\"row\": \"Total current assets\",\n\"column\": \"2025\",\n\"html_anchor\": \"fin101275_2\"\n,\n\"page\": null\n},\n\"evidence_quote\": \"Total current assets … 1,979,596 (2025 column; statement presented in thousands of US dollars)\"\n},\n{\n\"requested_field\": \"Assets\",\n\"outcome\": \"found\",\n\"value\": \"7193091\",\n\"scale\": \"1000\",\n\"source_label\": \"Consolidated statements of financial position — Total assets, As of December 31, 2025\",\n\"unit\": \"USD\",\n\"currency\": \"USD\",\n\"period\": {\"kind\": \"instant\", \"start\": null, \"end\": \"2025-12-31\"},\n\"accounting_basis\": \"IFRS\",\n\"consolidation_scope\": \"consolidated\",\n\"location\": {\n\"accession\": \"0001193125-26-197494\",\n\"document\": \"d101275d20f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"b842756f7ce62b0ae1bd2cf14d6fc3373c61297c0a74934f020493332415326e\",\n\"table\": \"Consolidated statements of financial position\",\n\"row\": \"Total assets\",\n\"column\": \"2025\",\n\"html_anchor\": \"fin101275_2\"\n,\n\"page\": null\n},\n\"evidence_quote\": \"Total assets … $ 7,193,091 (2025 column; statement presented in thousands of US dollars)\"\n},\n{\n\"requested_field\": \"LiabilitiesCurrent\",\n\"outcome\": \"found\",\n\"value\": \"3095938\",\n\"scale\": \"1000\",\n\"source_label\": \"Consolidated statements of financial position (continued) — Total current liabilities, As of December 31, 2025\",\n\"unit\": \"USD\",\n\"currency\": \"USD\",\n\"period\": {\"kind\": \"instant\", \"start\": null, \"end\": \"2025-12-31\"},\n\"accounting_basis\": \"IFRS\",\n\"consolidation_scope\": \"consolidated\",\n\"location\": {\n\"accession\": \"0001193125-26-197494\",\n\"document\": \"d101275d20f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"b842756f7ce62b0ae1bd2cf14d6fc3373c61297c0a74934f020493332415326e\",\n\"table\": \"Consolidated statements of financial position (continued)\",\n\"row\": \"Total current liabilities\",\n\"column\": \"2025\",\n\"html_anchor\": \"fin101275_2\"\n,\n\"page\": null\n},\n\"evidence_quote\": \"Total current liabilities … 3,095,938 (2025 column; statement presented in thousands of US dollars)\"\n},\n{\n\"requested_field\": \"Liabilities\",\n\"outcome\": \"found\",\n\"value\": \"7785307\",\n\"scale\": \"1000\",\n\"source_label\": \"Consolidated statements of financial position (continued) — Total liabilities, As of December 31, 2025\",\n\"unit\": \"USD\",\n\"currency\": \"USD\",\n\"period\": {\"kind\": \"instant\", \"start\": null, \"end\": \"2025-12-31\"},\n\"accounting_basis\": \"IFRS\",\n\"consolidation_scope\": \"consolidated\",\n\"location\": {\n\"accession\": \"0001193125-26-197494\",\n\"document\": \"d101275d20f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"b842756f7ce62b0ae1bd2cf14d6fc3373c61297c0a74934f020493332415326e\",\n\"table\": \"Consolidated statements of financial position (continued)\",\n\"row\": \"Total liabilities\",\n\"column\": \"2025\",\n\"html_anchor\": \"fin101275_2\"\n,\n\"page\": null\n},\n\"evidence_quote\": \"Total liabilities … 7,785,307 (2025 column; statement presented in thousands of US dollars)\"\n},\n{\n\"requested_field\": \"Equity\",\n\"outcome\": \"found\",\n\"value\": \"-592216\",\n\"scale\": \"1000\",\n\"source_label\": \"Consolidated statements of financial position (continued) — Total equity (deficit), As of December 31, 2025\",\n\"unit\": \"USD\",\n\"currency\": \"USD\",\n\"period\": {\"kind\": \"instant\", \"start\": null, \"end\": \"2025-12-31\"},\n\"accounting_basis\": \"IFRS\",\n\"consolidation_scope\": \"consolidated\",\n\"location\": {\n\"accession\": \"0001193125-26-197494\",\n\"document\": \"d101275d20f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"b842756f7ce62b0ae1bd2cf14d6fc3373c61297c0a74934f020493332415326e\",\n\"table\": \"Consolidated statements of financial position (continued)\",\n\"row\": \"Total equity (deficit)\",\n\"column\": \"2025\",\n\"html_anchor\": \"fin101275_2\"\n,\n\"page\": null\n},\n\"evidence_quote\": \"Total equity (deficit) … ( 592,216 ) (2025 column; shown in parentheses as a deficit, in thousands of US dollars)\"\n},\n{\n\"requested_field\": \"EquityAndLiabilities\",\n\"outcome\": \"found\",\n\"value\": \"7193091\",\n\"scale\": \"1000\",\n\"source_label\": \"Consolidated statements of financial position (continued) — Total equity (deficit) and liabilities, As of December 31, 2025\",\n\"unit\": \"USD\",\n\"currency\": \"USD\",\n\"period\": {\"kind\": \"instant\", \"start\": null, \"end\": \"2025-12-31\"},\n\"accounting_basis\": \"IFRS\",\n\"consolidation_scope\": \"consolidated\",\n\"location\": {\n\"accession\": \"0001193125-26-197494\",\n\"document\": \"d101275d20f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"b842756f7ce62b0ae1bd2cf14d6fc3373c61297c0a74934f020493332415326e\",\n\"table\": \"Consolidated statements of financial position (continued)\",\n\"row\": \"Total equity (deficit) and liabilities\",\n\"column\": \"2025\",\n\"html_anchor\": \"fin101275_2\"\n,\n\"page\": null\n},\n\"evidence_quote\": \"Total equity (deficit) and liabilities … $ 7,193,091 (2025 column; statement presented in thousands of US dollars)\"\n},\n{\n\"requested_field\": \"NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities\",\n\"outcome\": \"found\",\n\"value\": \"913081\",\n\"scale\": \"1000\",\n\"source_label\": \"Consolidated statements of cash flows — Net cash from operating activities, Year ended December 31, 2025\",\n\"unit\": \"USD\",\n\"currency\": \"USD\",\n\"period\": {\"kind\": \"duration\", \"start\": \"2025-01-01\", \"end\": \"2025-12-31\"},\n\"accounting_basis\": \"IFRS\",\n\"consolidation_scope\": \"consolidated\",\n\"location\": {\n\"accession\": \"0001193125-26-197494\",\n\"document\": \"d101275d20f.htm\",\n\"document_sha256\": \"b842756f7ce62b0ae1bd2cf14d6fc3373c61297c0a74934f020493332415326e\",\n\"table\": \"Consolidated statements of cash flows\",\n\"row\": \"Net cash from operating activities\",\n\"column\": \"2025\",\n\"html_anchor\": \"fin101275_5\"\n,\n\"page\": null\n},\n\"evidence_quote\": \"Net cash from operating activities … 913,081 (2025 column; statement presented in thousands of US dollars)\"\n}\n]\n}","reasoning_content":"Let me analyze the document to extract the requested financial statement fields.\n\nThe document is a Form 20-F annual report for Grupo Aeroméxico (ticker AERO), for fiscal year ended December 31, 2025.\n\nRequested fields:\n1. AssetsCurrent - Total current assets as of 2025-12-31\n2. Assets - Total assets as of 2025-12-31\n3. LiabilitiesCurrent - Total current liabilities as of 2025-12-31\n4. Liabilities - Total liabilities as of 2025-12-31\n5. Equity - Total equity as of 2025-12-31\n6. EquityAndLiabilities - Total equity and liabilities as of 2025-12-31\n7. NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities - Net cash from operating activities for 2025\n\nLooking at the consolidated statements of financial position (in the audited financial statements section, in thousands of US dollars):\n\nFrom T:A:638 (Consolidated statements of financial position):\n- Total current assets (ifrs-full:CurrentAssets;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2025): 1,979,596 (in thousands USD)\n- Total assets (ifrs-full:Assets;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2025): 7,193,091 (in thousands USD)\n\nFrom T:A:639 (Consolidated statements of financial position continued):\n- Total current liabilities (ifrs-full:CurrentLiabilities;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2025): 3,095,938 (in thousands USD)\n- Total liabilities (ifrs-full:Liabilities;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2025): 7,785,307 (in thousands USD)\n- Total equity (deficit) (ifrs-full:Equity;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2025): (592,216) (in thousands USD) - this is a deficit, shown in parentheses with sgn=-\n- Total equity (deficit) and liabilities (ifrs-full:EquityAndLiabilities;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2025): 7,193,091 (in thousands USD)\n\nFrom T:A:645 (Consolidated statements of cash flows):\n- Net cash from operating activities (ifrs-full:CashFlowsFromUsedInOperatingActivities;ctx=P01_01_2025To12_31_2025): 913,081 (in thousands USD)\n\nAlso from T:A:455 (summary in Item 5):\n- Net cash from operating activities: 913.1 (in millions of U.S.$)\n\nNow let me format the output. The document has inline XBRL tags with the facts. The scale should represent the units. The financial statements are \"(In thousands of US dollars)\", so scale is 1000 (since values like 1,979,596 are in thousands). Wait, the scale pattern is \"^[1-9][0-9]*$\" - so scale should be \"1000\"? Let me think.\n\nThe value pattern is \"^-?(0|[1-9][0-9]*)(\\.[0-9]+)?$\" - so value is a number. The scale field... In the XBRL, s=3 means the value is scaled by 10^3 (i.e., reported in thousands). Actually looking at the tags: `u=Unit_USD;s=3;d=-3` - s=3 means scale 3 (thousands), d=-3 means decimals -3 (rounded to thousands).\n\nSo the value \"1,979,596\" with scale \"1000\" would mean 1,979,596 × 1000 = 1,979,596,000 USD. That makes sense - the financial statements are in thousands of USD, and the tagged value is the number in thousands, so multiplying by scale 1000 gives the actual USD value.\n\nLet me verify: Total current assets 2025 = 1,979,596 thousand USD = $1,979.6 million. Yes, the MD&A table (T:A:385) shows \"Total current assets: 1,979.6\" in millions of US dollars. Consistent.\n\nSo:\n1. AssetsCurrent: value = \"1979596\", scale = \"1000\", unit = \"USD\", currency = \"USD\", period: instant, 2025-12-31\n2. Assets: value = \"7193091\", scale = \"1000\", unit = \"USD\", currency = \"USD\"\n3. LiabilitiesCurrent: value = \"3095938\", scale = \"1000\"\n4. Liabilities: value = \"7785307\", scale = \"1000\"\n5. Equity: value = \"-592216\", scale = \"1000\" (total deficit)\n6. EquityAndLiabilities: value = \"7193091\", scale = \"1000\"\n7. NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities: value = \"913081\", scale = \"1000\", period: duration 2025-01-01 to 2025-12-31\n\nAccounting basis: IFRS\nConsolidation scope: consolidated\n\nLocations: The consolidated statements of financial position appear in the document. I need to provide a locator. The document uses anchors like \"fin101275_2\" for the consolidated statements of financial position link. The table IDs are T:A:638, T:A:639, T:A:645.\n\nLet me think about the location structure:\n- accession: \"0001193125-26-197494\"\n- document: \"d101275d20f.htm\"\n- document_sha256: \"b842756f7ce62b0ae1bd2cf14d6fc3373c61297c0a74934f020493332415326e\"\n- table: could be the table reference\n- row: the row label\n- column: the column label\n- html_anchor: for location we need either html_anchor or page. The location schema requires allOf with anyOf - so we need either html_anchor or page. The html_anchor could be \"fin101275_2\" for the balance sheet and \"fin101275_5\" for the cash flow statement.\n\nWait, looking at the location schema:\n```\n\"location\": {\"additionalProperties\": false, \"allOf\": [{\"anyOf\": [{\"properties\": {\"html_anchor\": {\"minLength\": 1, \"type\": \"string\"}}, \"required\": [\"html_anchor\"]}, {\"properties\": {\"page\": {\"minimum\": 1, \"type\": \"integer\"}}, \"required\": [\"page\"]}]}, ...\n```\n\nSo each location must have either html_anchor or page. Since the document has LINK anchors to \"fin101275_2\" (Consolidated statements of financial position), I can use that as html_anchor.\n\nFor the balance sheet: html_anchor = \"fin101275_2\"\nFor the cash flow statement: html_anchor = \"fin101275_5\"\n\nRow and column: \n- For AssetsCurrent: row = \"Total current assets\", column = \"2025\"\n- For Assets: row = \"Total assets\", column = \"2025\"\n- For LiabilitiesCurrent: row = \"Total current liabilities\", column = \"2025\"\n- For Liabilities: row = \"Total liabilities\", column = \"2025\"\n- For Equity: row = \"Total equity (deficit)\", column = \"2025\"\n- For EquityAndLiabilities: row = \"Total equity (deficit) and liabilities\", column = \"2025\"\n- For NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities: row = \"Net cash from operating activities\", column = \"2025\"\n\nTable: \"Consolidated statements of financial position\" for the first six, \"Consolidated statements of cash flows\" for the last one.\n\nEvidence quotes:\n- AssetsCurrent: \"Total current assets ... 1,979,596\"\n- Assets: \"Total assets ... $ 7,193,091\"\n- LiabilitiesCurrent: \"Total current liabilities ... 3,095,938\"\n- Liabilities: \"Total liabilities ... 7,785,307\"\n- Equity: \"Total equity (deficit) ... ( 592,216 )\"\n- EquityAndLiabilities: \"Total equity (deficit) and liabilities ... $ 7,193,091\"\n- NetCash: \"Net cash from operating activities ... 913,081\"\n\nLet me construct evidence quotes carefully (max 400 chars):\n\nFor AssetsCurrent from T:A:638:\n\"<S:A:C638.12.1>Total current assets | <S:A:C638.12.8>...1,979,596\"\nI'll quote: \"Total current assets ... 1,979,596 (2025)\" - I should quote the actual text. The text in the cell is \"Total current assets\" and value \"1,979,596\". Let me write: \"Total current assets — 1,979,596\"\n\nActually the evidence quote should be verbatim-ish. Let me use:\n- \"Total current assets ... <ifrs-full:CurrentAssets;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2025>1,979,596\"\n\nHmm, the quotes include the S: markers. Let me just use plain text quotes that reflect the visible content.\n\nFor the \"found\" object:\n- requested_field: \"AssetsCurrent\"\n- outcome: \"found\"\n- value: \"1979596\"\n- scale: \"1000\"\n- source_label: \"Consolidated statements of financial position — Total current assets (2025)\"\n- unit: \"USD\"\n- currency: \"USD\"\n- period: {\"kind\": \"instant\", \"start\": null, \"end\": \"2025-12-31\"}\n- accounting_basis: \"IFRS\"\n- consolidation_scope: \"consolidated\"\n- location: {...}\n- evidence_quote: \"...\"\n\nWait, unit pattern: \"^(?:[A-Z]{3}|[A-Z]{3}/shares|shares|pure)$\" - \"USD\" works.\n\nFor the cash flow statement, the period is duration: start \"2025-01-01\", end \"2025-12-31\".\n\nNow, one consideration: should I use the primary financial statements (F-pages) or the MD&A summary tables? The definition says \"explicitly reported on the consolidated primary balance sheet\". The primary financial statements are the \"Consolidated statements of financial position\" at F-6 (in thousands of US dollars). I found those. Good.\n\nNote the MD&A table T:A:385 shows the same values in millions.\n\nLet me double check the values from the XBRL tags:\n\nT:A:638:\n- <S:A:C638.12.8><S:A:A:ixv-64800;n=ifrs-full:CurrentAssets;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2025;u=Unit_USD;s=3;d=-3>1,979,596 → AssetsCurrent = 1,979,596 (thousands)\n- <S:A:C638.24.8><S:A:A:ixv-64823;n=ifrs-full:Assets;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2025;u=Unit_USD;s=3;d=-3>7,193,091 → Assets = 7,193,091\n\nT:A:639:\n- <S:A:C639.13.8><S:A:A:ixv-64847;n=ifrs-full:CurrentLiabilities;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2025;u=Unit_USD;s=3;d=-3>3,095,938 → LiabilitiesCurrent = 3,095,938\n- <S:A:C639.24.8><S:A:A:ixv-64868;n=ifrs-full:Liabilities;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2025;u=Unit_USD;s=3;d=-3>7,785,307 → Liabilities = 7,785,307\n- <S:A:C639.39.8>( <S:A:A:ixv-64898;n=ifrs-full:Equity;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2025;u=Unit_USD;s=3;d=-3;sgn=->592,216 ) → Equity = -592,216\n- <S:A:C639.41.8><S:A:A:ixv-64901;n=ifrs-full:EquityAndLiabilities;ctx=PAsOn12_31_2025;u=Unit_USD;s=3;d=-3>7,193,091 → EquityAndLiabilities = 7,193,091\n\nT:A:645:\n- <S:A:C645.36.8><S:A:A:ixv-65207;n=ifrs-full:CashFlowsFromUsedInOperatingActivities;ctx=P01_01_2025To12_31_2025;u=Unit_USD;s=3;d=-3>913,081 → NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities = 913,081\n\nAll values confirmed.\n\nNow regarding scale: The financial statements state \"(In thousands of US dollars)\". The tagged values with s=3 confirm thousand scaling. So scale = \"1000\" and value = the number as printed. This represents USD 1,979,596,000 etc.\n\nFor the equity deficit, the printed value is \"(592,216)\" with sgn=-, so value = \"-592216\".\n\nNow the location fields. The location schema requires:\n- accession\n- document\n- document_sha256\n- table\n- row\n- column\n- and either html_anchor or page (via allOf/anyOf)\n\nhtml_anchor: The document shows `<LINK:#fin101275_2>Consolidated statements of financial position` - so the anchor \"fin101275_2\" is the link target for the balance sheet. For cash flows: `<LINK:#fin101275_5>Consolidated statements of cash flows` → \"fin101275_5\".\n\nActually, wait. The LINK elements are `<LINK:#fin101275_2>` which suggests anchor id \"fin101275_2\". The anchor `<S:A:A:toc101275_85>ITEM 18. FINANCIAL STATEMENTS` etc. For the balance sheet row in T:A:627: `<S:A:C627.4.1><LINK:#fin101275_2>Consolidated statements of financial position`. So \"fin101275_2\" is the HTML anchor for the balance sheet.\n\nTable field: I'll use descriptive table names like \"Consolidated statements of financial position\" or maybe the table tag identifier \"T:A:638\". The schema just requires a string. I'll use the descriptive name plus maybe the tag. Let me use \"Consolidated statements of financial position\" and \"Consolidated statements of cash flows\".\n\nRow: \"Total current assets\" etc.\nColumn: \"2025\" (or \"As of December 31, 2025\").\n\nNow let me also double check whether there might be ambiguity between the MD&A summary (in millions) and the primary statements (in thousands). The definition says \"explicitly reported on the consolidated primary balance sheet\" — the primary balance sheet is the audited \"Consolidated statements of financial position\". The MD&A table is a summary of financial position data, not the primary balance sheet. So no ambiguity; I'll use the primary statements. I could mention checked locations though. But for \"found\" outcome, I just need one location. That's fine.\n\nFor the cash flow: \"Net cash from operating activities\" — the requested field is NetCashProvidedByUsedInOperatingActivities. In the primary cash flow statement it's \"Net cash from operating activities\" = 913,081. Good.\n\nLet me now build the JSON.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"schema\": \"statement_candidate_v1\",\n  \"request_id\": \"pilot-aero-primary-v1\",\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"requested_field\": \"AssetsCurrent\",\n      \"outcome\": \"found\",\n      \"value\": \"1979596\",\n      \"scale\": \"1000\",\n      \"source_label\": \"Consolidated statements of financial position — Total current assets, As of December 31, 2025\",\n      \"unit\": \"USD\",\n      \"currency\": \"USD\",\n      \"period\": {\"kind\": \"instant\", \"start\": null, \"end\": \"2025-12-31\"},\n      \"accounting_basis\": \"IFRS\",\n      \"consolidation_scope\": \"consolidated\",\n      \"location\": {\n        \"accession\": \"0001193125-26-197494\",\n        \"document\": \"d101275d20f.htm\",\n        \"document_sha256\": \"b842756f7ce62b0ae1bd2cf14d6fc3373c61297c0a74934f020493332415326e\",\n        \"table\": \"Consolidated statements of financial position\",\n        \"row\": \"Total current assets\",\n        \"column\": \"2025\",\n        \"html_anchor\": \"fin101275_2\",\n        \"page\": null\n      },\n      \"evidence_quote\": \"Total current assets ... 1,979,596 (2025 column, in thousands of US dollars)\"\n    },\n    ...\n  ]\n}\n```\n\nWait — the location schema has additionalProperties: false with properties including both html_anchor and page. If I include \"page\": null, is that valid? page type is [\